Package: com.atreb92.crappytouch
Name: crappytouch
Version: 0.6.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Lets a paired computer running scrcrappy control this iPhone over USB: touch, keys and buttons, text, clipboard, screen info and screenshots, listing and opening apps, and opening URLs. Can keep the phone awake while connected. Localhost only; a new computer needs an Allow on the phone.
Maintainer: scrcrappy
Author: scrcrappy
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate | ellekit, preferenceloader
Icon: https://atreb92.github.io/crappytouch/icon.png
SileoDepiction: https://atreb92.github.io/crappytouch/depictions/com.atreb92.crappytouch.json
Homepage: https://github.com/Atreb92/crappytouch
